  "content_id": "16136239",
  "title": "zkSync Era Network Fees",
  "description": "zkSync Era – Speed and Scalability Together\nzkSync Era is a next-generation Layer 2 that uses zero-knowledge rollups for fast, private, an...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ1RFQD56ZTNVVHFTFZ2VXR\">zkSync Era – Speed and Scalability Together</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">zkSync Era is a next-generation Layer 2 that uses zero-knowledge rollups for fast, private, and cheap Ethereum transactions.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ1RFQDFGNAT5YY30GJME74\">How zkSync Era Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Gas usage (gwei)</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Network conditions</b></p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge estimates zkSync fees using real-time network data.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ1RFQDN9K1W0Q6BW1J9329\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Fastest confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Best balance</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Slowest and cheapest</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Set your own fee manually</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ1RFQD2RR67618FEWS2523\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Roughly <b>$0.01 to $0.03 USD</b> per transaction.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ1RFQDDBNX7F5GT69024K4\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">zkSync Era gives you fast, cheaper transactions with added privacy. Edge makes fee management easy whether you need speed, privacy, or savings.</p>",
